{"slug":"super-why","name":"Super_WHY","version":"20261009","models":[{"name":"Super_WHY 卡片","css":".card { font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif; text-align: center;\n        background: #fffdf6; color: #222; padding: 14px; }\n.kind { display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; color: #fff; background: #3a7bd5;\n        border-radius: 12px; padding: 2px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.imgs { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.imgs figure { margin: 0; flex: 1 1 280px; max-width: 480px; }\n.imgs img { width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; }\n.imgs figcaption { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #d9534f; }\n.ask { font-size: 24px; margin: 14px 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n.answer { font-size: 44px; font-weight: bold; color: #2e7d32; margin: 12px 0; }\n.tip { font-size: 15px; color: #666; background: #f3f0e6; border-radius: 8px;\n       padding: 8px 12px; margin-top: 14px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6; }\n.card.nightMode, .nightMode .card { background: #222; color: #eee; }\n.nightMode .answer { color: #7fd184; }\n.nightMode .tip { background: #333; color: #bbb; }\n"}],"cards":[{"k":"super-why:1791167723672","f":"<div class=\"kind\">对比卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/4f8a6b0d5fd0fd64055c.jpg\"><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/media/6c50ddeb4581d92ce604.jpg\"><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/c6b34044d83f2d51a96c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">听！狼说 \"I'm small\"。哪一只是 <b>small</b> 的狼？指一指！<br>Listen! Which wolf is <b>small</b>? Point to it!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">对比卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/4f8a6b0d5fd0fd64055c.jpg\"><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/media/6c50ddeb4581d92ce604.jpg\"><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/c6b34044d83f2d51a96c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">听！狼说 \"I'm small\"。哪一只是 <b>small</b> 的狼？指一指！<br>Listen! Which wolf is <b>small</b>? Point to it!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">small 🐺 / big 🐺</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/ddc1efd60250bfd7d7ab.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是大狼说 \"I am the big bad wolf\"。复习完拿家里一大一小两样东西，问 \"Which one is small?\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","对比卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723674","f":"<div class=\"kind\">场景句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8bd14c980d988553cf8f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/e64fff314c5609751213.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">这只狼说他是 good wolf。他是<b>好</b>狼还是<b>坏</b>狼？<br>He says he is a <b>good</b> wolf. Is he <b>good</b> or <b>bad</b>?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">场景句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8bd14c980d988553cf8f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/e64fff314c5609751213.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">这只狼说他是 good wolf。他是<b>好</b>狼还是<b>坏</b>狼？<br>He says he is a <b>good</b> wolf. Is he <b>good</b> or <b>bad</b>?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">good wolf 😊</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/fb09be8d53dac01acf1e.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/e64fff314c5609751213.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是之前的 bad wolf（凶脸），对比着看。让他跟读 \"small good wolf\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","场景句卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723676","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/21fc17136fbee3e4d798.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Jill 对小猪的积木做了什么？用手做一遍这个动作！<br>What did Jill do to the pig's blocks? Do the action!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/21fc17136fbee3e4d798.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Jill 对小猪的积木做了什么？用手做一遍这个动作！<br>What did Jill do to the pig's blocks? Do the action!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">knock down 💥</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/3f14c916e19b7f79715d.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/69be48a09b6a8002f1d4.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 这一集 knock down 出现了十几次，是全集主线。拿积木搭一座塔，让他一边推倒一边说 \"Knock it down!\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723678","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/af71932da6a16500430a.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">大灰狼在干什么？跟他一起吹！<br>What is the wolf doing? Do it with him!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/af71932da6a16500430a.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">大灰狼在干什么？跟他一起吹！<br>What is the wolf doing? Do it with him!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">huff and puff and <b>blow</b> 🌬️</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/af69edd0cf5ade9c1635.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 让他鼓起腮帮子真的吹：huff（吸气）— puff（鼓起来）— blow（吹出去）。能吹倒一张纸就更好玩。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723680","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/69f1c0977e814690c757.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Wonder Red 在推大球干什么？做一遍这个动作！<br>What is Wonder Red doing with the ball? Do the action!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/69f1c0977e814690c757.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Wonder Red 在推大球干什么？做一遍这个动作！<br>What is Wonder Red doing with the ball? Do the action!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\"><b>roll</b> the ball 🟤</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/a9bcd26b30b9a580e8a6.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/a8644df573fe55a90f0d.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是 \"We can roll a ball out of the way\"。在地上滚一个球给他，让他一边滚回来一边说 \"Roll, roll!\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723682","f":"<div class=\"kind\">社交句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/1a57ca3ddfec4164ee87.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7f26bea9f35e9068a7ac.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪在对 Jill 说什么？你演小猪，爸爸演 Jill，说一遍！<br>What does the pig say to Jill? You are the pig, Dad is Jill. Say it!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">社交句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/1a57ca3ddfec4164ee87.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7f26bea9f35e9068a7ac.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪在对 Jill 说什么？你演小猪，爸爸演 Jill，说一遍！<br>What does the pig say to Jill? You are the pig, Dad is Jill. Say it!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">Would you like to play with me? 🙋</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/3d0f71c0ffddc761ff34.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是 Jill 高兴地回答 \"You want to be my friend and play with me?\"。下次想找小朋友玩，就这样说；今天找机会让他真的对家人或小朋友说一次。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","社交句卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723684","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/49e9f2f44b82e7e039cb.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/71450d077c5a9868bfba.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪和 Jill 最后变成了什么？<br>What did the pig and Jill become in the end?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/49e9f2f44b82e7e039cb.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/71450d077c5a9868bfba.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪和 Jill 最后变成了什么？<br>What did the pig and Jill become in the end?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">friend 🤝</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/4da1fd9ddb925f377029.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 friend 是这一集的\"超级答案\"。复习完问他 \"Who is your friend?\"，让他用 \"___ is my friend.\" 回答。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723686","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8dac39767eb00350fb8f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/de1e1740a2daabe7ac2c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 在找山坡上那些粉红色的东西，它们叫什么？<br>What are the pink things on the hill that Super Why is looking for?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8dac39767eb00350fb8f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/de1e1740a2daabe7ac2c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 在找山坡上那些粉红色的东西，它们叫什么？<br>What are the pink things on the hill that Super Why is looking for?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">letter 🔤</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/11447efb7a83bc361b20.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是 \"Read the letters with me\"。在冰箱贴或绘本上指一个字母，问 \"What letter is this?\"，他说出任何一个字母名都算对。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723688","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/04677fb3cc2d3c080654.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/fe6f32de45dbffbdb55c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 旁边这个大大的东西是什么？<br>What is the big thing next to Super Why?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/04677fb3cc2d3c080654.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/fe6f32de45dbffbdb55c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 旁边这个大大的东西是什么？<br>What is the big thing next to Super Why?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">book 📖</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/302c40eaff7904800cdc.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是 \"When we have a question, we look in a book\"。睡前拿一本绘本问 \"What's this?\"，让他答 \"A book!\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723690","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/a1cb62718f32425160ee.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/b1eb92ad6b5c2bf87d64.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">大灰狼站在什么旁边？<br>What is the wolf standing next to?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/a1cb62718f32425160ee.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/b1eb92ad6b5c2bf87d64.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">大灰狼站在什么旁边？<br>What is the wolf standing next to?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">house 🏠</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c1c366ea82939fee4b53.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/aac7d97f5f2404701638.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是被吹倒的稻草房子。用积木或纸盒搭一个 house，让他指着说 \"My house!\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723692","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/f9b67becda77c92f24d8.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/dd66979b54114dafe991.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">超级读者们被什么挡住了路？<br>What is blocking the Super Readers' way?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/f9b67becda77c92f24d8.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/dd66979b54114dafe991.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">超级读者们被什么挡住了路？<br>What is blocking the Super Readers' way?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">wall 🧱</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8efcbfacfa5a68b2e57b.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/65669c2bd9e1c318d0c9.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是 wall 变高了（tall wall）。在家里拍拍墙问 \"What's this?\"，让他答 \"A wall!\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791167723694","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8dec6a03b5dd49bfc25f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/e886ba3ec85ee10540fe.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 手里拿的是什么？超级字母要放进去的那个东西！<br>What is Super Why holding? The super letters go into it!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/8dec6a03b5dd49bfc25f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/e886ba3ec85ee10540fe.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 手里拿的是什么？超级字母要放进去的那个东西！<br>What is Super Why holding? The super letters go into it!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">computer 💻</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/53ade8285dbb29b083de.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是最后一次喊 \"Super duper computer\"。指着家里的电脑或平板问 \"What's this?\"，让他答 \"A computer!\"</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E01","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785861","f":"<div class=\"kind\">对比卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c6c0cb717100a22ef0db.jpg\"><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/media/ea22b1b4dc96d12a0f7d.jpg\"><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/c9b1b1238c5b8844eb56.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">听！门现在被 <b>open</b>（打开）了。哪张图里的门是开着的？指一指！<br>Listen! The door is <b>open</b>. Which picture shows the open door? Point!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">对比卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c6c0cb717100a22ef0db.jpg\"><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/media/ea22b1b4dc96d12a0f7d.jpg\"><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/c9b1b1238c5b8844eb56.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">听！门现在被 <b>open</b>（打开）了。哪张图里的门是开着的？指一指！<br>Listen! The door is <b>open</b>. Which picture shows the open door? Point!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">open / close 🚪</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/b9fa34b774b7d0ed79e0.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 正面原声是 \"opens\"（第三人称单数），这里只学原形 open / close，变形以后再学。背面原声说女巫把门关上了。找家里的一扇门，轮流边开关边说 \"Open! Close!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","对比卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785863","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/d2537df4384c1d742cfc.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 拿着辣椒在干什么？做一遍这个动作！<br>What is Red doing with the pepper? Do the action!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/d2537df4384c1d742cfc.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 拿着辣椒在干什么？做一遍这个动作！<br>What is Red doing with the pepper? Do the action!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">eat 🌶️</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/d6cc79bd525b92b145a1.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/dd83ff8aa606ba55e028.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是女巫发现孩子们在吃她的房子。吃点心时让孩子拿起一小口，边吃边说 \"Eat!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785865","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/eaf24090ff5d396d6f25.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Whyatt 对着书在干什么？拿一本书做一遍！<br>What is Whyatt doing with the book? Do it with a book!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/eaf24090ff5d396d6f25.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Whyatt 对着书在干什么？拿一本书做一遍！<br>What is Whyatt doing with the book? Do it with a book!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">read 📖</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/f2b9da626d1eed62d538.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/8c745121cfea3bdf6b3d.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声请大家一起读。拿一本熟悉的绘本，请孩子翻开并说 \"Read with me!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785867","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/aa1dec2999b605777c71.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 拿着桨在干什么？用双手做一遍！<br>What is Super Why doing with the paddle? Do it with your hands!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/aa1dec2999b605777c71.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 拿着桨在干什么？用双手做一遍！<br>What is Super Why doing with the paddle? Do it with your hands!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">row 🚣</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/f8f0e6949eb9052a5f88.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/70c7b0be45c37a68c82e.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声说继续划。两人坐地上假装坐船，一起前后摆手说 \"Row, row!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785869","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/4e25e210b20cb70a9469.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 用魔法棒做什么？拿手指当魔法棒做一遍！<br>What does Super Why do with the wand? Use your finger as a wand!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/4e25e210b20cb70a9469.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 用魔法棒做什么？拿手指当魔法棒做一遍！<br>What does Super Why do with the wand? Use your finger as a wand!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">zap ✨</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/fdb9ca8203e8c3b9486b.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/1213ce54556a8614d233.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声邀请大家一起施魔法。指向纸上画的一扇门，挥手指说 \"Zap!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785871","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/91530839af400f6edf58.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">公主对坏掉的屋顶做了什么？假装拿工具修一修！<br>What did the princess do to the broken roof? Pretend to use tools!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/91530839af400f6edf58.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">公主对坏掉的屋顶做了什么？假装拿工具修一修！<br>What did the princess do to the broken roof? Pretend to use tools!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">fix 🛠️</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/b17f616b72e05ae693a7.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/7903349517a54be985c5.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是女巫发现屋顶修好了。拿一块松开的积木让孩子装回去，边装边说 \"Fix it!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785873","f":"<div class=\"kind\">社交句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/51ec8d19e8aff350155d.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7fe10f34bf5e534510b5.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 在对 Peter 说什么？你演 Red，爸爸演 Peter，说一遍！<br>What does Red say to Peter? You are Red, Dad is Peter. Say it!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">社交句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/51ec8d19e8aff350155d.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7fe10f34bf5e534510b5.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 在对 Peter 说什么？你演 Red，爸爸演 Peter，说一遍！<br>What does Red say to Peter? You are Red, Dad is Peter. Say it!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">May I have one? 🙋</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/c0455e82cabdc8ea75b5.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是 Peter 答应她的请求。今天分点心时让孩子先问一次 \"May I have one?\"，爸爸回答 \"Of course!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","社交句卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785875","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c6120e8af9052c09691f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/ff28f19ddfe43b2ebfcd.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 想拿 Peter 的辣椒，应该先做什么？<br>Red wants Peter's pepper. What should she do first?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c6120e8af9052c09691f.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/ff28f19ddfe43b2ebfcd.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 想拿 Peter 的辣椒，应该先做什么？<br>Red wants Peter's pepper. What should she do first?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">Ask first! 🙋</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/bfe740eabe47984d2021.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是电脑揭晓的超级答案。孩子想拿家人的东西时，提醒他说 \"Ask first!\"，再开口询问。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785877","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/9a25266b7e7262eba18e.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/476f396011d7a9400207.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 从 Peter 的篮子里拿了什么？<br>What did Red take from Peter's basket?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/9a25266b7e7262eba18e.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/476f396011d7a9400207.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Red 从 Peter 的篮子里拿了什么？<br>What did Red take from Peter's basket?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">pepper 🌶️</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/1cb03800249feacf57db.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是 Peter 说这些辣椒属于他。吃饭时指着家里的辣椒或甜椒问 \"Where are the peppers?\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785879","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/1f7c414609380c14ca1b.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/1721617a359f1f83c041.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">女巫手里的小房子是用什么做的？<br>What are the witch's little houses made of?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/1f7c414609380c14ca1b.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/1721617a359f1f83c041.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">女巫手里的小房子是用什么做的？<br>What are the witch's little houses made of?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">cookie 🍪</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/558c799d9aa496f04285.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声还提到这座姜饼饼干屋。拿一块饼干问 \"Cookie?\"，孩子说出 \"Cookie!\" 再吃。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785881","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/1e20d90bd96b5c181240.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/a46b6935b05e9fe25239.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">女巫正在啃房子的什么部分？<br>Which part of the house is the witch eating?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/1e20d90bd96b5c181240.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/a46b6935b05e9fe25239.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">女巫正在啃房子的什么部分？<br>Which part of the house is the witch eating?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">door 🚪</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/ea22b1b4dc96d12a0f7d.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/c9b1b1238c5b8844eb56.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是女巫把门打开。回家时让孩子指着家门说 \"Door!\"，再试着开门。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791172785883","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/322221238c229f3bafb0.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/bfc8481c097dbb91fc7a.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">大家乘着什么过小河？<br>What do they ride across the stream?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/322221238c229f3bafb0.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/bfc8481c097dbb91fc7a.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">大家乘着什么过小河？<br>What do they ride across the stream?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">raft 🛶</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/e0d1af88cdb352c55bbf.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/02d0aa00ad0bf4340ef6.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声说他们要坐木筏过河。用几支铅笔并排摆成小木筏，推着它说 \"Raft!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E02","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047803","f":"<div class=\"kind\">对比卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c1ae44c2e9cb01ff6204.jpg\"><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/media/eec056527ff4f2642730.jpg\"><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/6ecbcb5555cc7024fc13.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">听！Humpty 从滑梯上下来了。哪一张图里他在 <b>down</b>（下面）？指一指！<br>Listen! Which picture shows Humpty <b>down</b> at the bottom? Point to it!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">对比卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c1ae44c2e9cb01ff6204.jpg\"><figcaption>A</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/media/eec056527ff4f2642730.jpg\"><figcaption>B</figcaption></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/6ecbcb5555cc7024fc13.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">听！Humpty 从滑梯上下来了。哪一张图里他在 <b>down</b>（下面）？指一指！<br>Listen! Which picture shows Humpty <b>down</b> at the bottom? Point to it!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">down / up ↕️</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/a6a60e745ef0e79c227e.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 A 图 Humpty 在滑梯下面（down），B 图他在滑梯顶上（up）。背面原声是 Humpty 爬上墙（climbed 是过去式，先学原形 climb）。把玩偶举高再放低，边做边说 \"Up! Down!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","对比卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047805","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7859fbcb0be3ae98b353.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 正在梯子上做什么？交替抬手抬脚，做一遍！<br>What is Super Why doing on the ladder? Do the action with your arms and legs!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7859fbcb0be3ae98b353.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Super Why 正在梯子上做什么？交替抬手抬脚，做一遍！<br>What is Super Why doing on the ladder? Do the action with your arms and legs!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\"><b>climb</b> up 🪜</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/6c873568f3c0f83b8424.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面原声是 \"climb up the ladder\"（爬上梯子）。站在地上交替抬手抬脚假装爬梯子，边做边说 \"Climb up!\"，也可以让孩子爬沙发边。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047807","f":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/656075afafc966d40e2f.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Humpty 从滑梯上做了什么？用玩偶演一遍！<br>What did Humpty do on the slide? Act it out with a toy!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">动作卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/656075afafc966d40e2f.mp4\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">Humpty 从滑梯上做了什么？用玩偶演一遍！<br>What did Humpty do on the slide? Act it out with a toy!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\"><b>go</b> down the slide 🛝</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/afb1d9c5a803957b620b.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/b095f014cb74ba4aa743.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 视频原声是 \"went down the slide\"（went 是 go 的过去式，先学原形 go）；背面是小猪说 \"to go down the slide\"（要从滑梯上滑下来）。用书搭一个斜坡，让玩偶滑下去，孩子边做边说 \"Go down the slide!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","动作卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047809","f":"<div class=\"kind\">整句卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7ec4c61fb8f904f7c7df.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">（只听声音）<br>跟着喊出来！<br>(Listen only.) Say it out loud!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">整句卡</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7ec4c61fb8f904f7c7df.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">（只听声音）<br>跟着喊出来！<br>(Listen only.) Say it out loud!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">You can do it! 💪</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/7e66984e606cc5d2881b.jpg\"></figure></div><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是小猪在滑梯顶上，朋友们正在给他加油。孩子尝试投球、搭积木时，爸爸先喊 \"You can do it!\"，再互换角色；喊出来就算过，不要求发音完美。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","整句卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047811","f":"<div class=\"kind\">社交句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/618473b63d339b9d2293.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/b9a11d6c7b71896f0e2a.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪在请朋友们帮他做什么？你演小猪，爸爸演朋友，说一遍！<br>What does Pig ask his friends to do? You are Pig, Dad is a friend. Say it!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">社交句卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/618473b63d339b9d2293.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/b9a11d6c7b71896f0e2a.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪在请朋友们帮他做什么？你演小猪，爸爸演朋友，说一遍！<br>What does Pig ask his friends to do? You are Pig, Dad is a friend. Say it!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">Will you cheer for me too? 🙋</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/5148954238d1e285295c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是 Whyatt 号召大家给小猪加油。今天孩子在尝试投球或新游戏前，让他真的问爸爸一次 \"Will you cheer for me too?\"，爸爸马上用 \"You can do it!\" 回应。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","社交句卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047813","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/bf39e5be68bac879a6c1.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/5148954238d1e285295c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">朋友们做了什么，帮助小猪不再害怕？<br>What did the friends do to help Pig not be afraid?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/bf39e5be68bac879a6c1.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/5148954238d1e285295c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">朋友们做了什么，帮助小猪不再害怕？<br>What did the friends do to help Pig not be afraid?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">cheer 📣</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/b18d32fc11727baea07c.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是 Super Story Answer 揭晓时的 cheer（加油、欢呼）。家庭游戏前问 \"Who can we cheer for?\"，让孩子答 \"Cheer for Dad!\"，然后真的给爸爸加油。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047815","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c7d671336801c229524a.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/2b7a9bef2f3a034ed403.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪后院里新建好的、黄色的是什么？<br>What is the new yellow thing in Pig's backyard?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c7d671336801c229524a.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/2b7a9bef2f3a034ed403.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪后院里新建好的、黄色的是什么？<br>What is the new yellow thing in Pig's backyard?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">slide 🛝</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/3a7b33a9147715eaa323.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是朋友们夸 \"Nice slide\"。带孩子到小区滑梯边问 \"What's this?\"，让他答 \"A slide!\"，再说 \"I like the slide.\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047817","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/0adea13c8aa2a5f8e608.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/4c0b222cb85676160f25.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">公主变出了什么，帮大家爬上墙？<br>What did the princess make to help them climb up the wall?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/0adea13c8aa2a5f8e608.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/4c0b222cb85676160f25.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">公主变出了什么，帮大家爬上墙？<br>What did the princess make to help them climb up the wall?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">ladder 🪜</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/c36b3d2527b95bad3f8c.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/6c873568f3c0f83b8424.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是 Super Why 走向梯子的画面。用积木或椅子摆一架小梯子，问 \"What's this?\"，让孩子答 \"A ladder!\"，再让玩偶爬上去。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047819","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/d7ff4ba08eb109e587c9.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7def7c061affd098d4ef.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">挡住超级读者们去路的是什么动物？<br>What animals are blocking the Super Readers' way?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/d7ff4ba08eb109e587c9.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/7def7c061affd098d4ef.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">挡住超级读者们去路的是什么动物？<br>What animals are blocking the Super Readers' way?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">horse 🐴</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/c27fa6da20e448de3deb.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 原声里是复数 horses，答案先学单数 horse，以后再学复数。拿动物玩具或绘本问 \"Where is the horse?\"，让孩子指着答 \"Here is the horse!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047821","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/30c8a5bad11392066012.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/bb41a87fd4a40ca9c194.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪在字母 A 的摊位上找到了什么水果？<br>What fruit did Pig find at the letter A stand?</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/30c8a5bad11392066012.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/bb41a87fd4a40ca9c194.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪在字母 A 的摊位上找到了什么水果？<br>What fruit did Pig find at the letter A stand?</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">apple 🍎</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/2eb471ac7ac3cd55eaa3.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 正面原声是复数 apples，答案先学单数 apple；背面是 Super Why 说 \"apple\"。拿一个真苹果问 \"What's this?\"，让孩子答 \"An apple!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"},{"k":"super-why:1791338047823","f":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/4423dae2316f33f7e83c.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/07e02374677a46ec4044.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪坐在高高的滑梯顶上，他说他觉得怎么样？你来学一遍！<br>How does Pig say he feels at the top of the slide? Say it like Pig!</div>","b":"<div class=\"kind\">核心词卡</div><div class=\"imgs\"><figure><img src=\"/media/4423dae2316f33f7e83c.jpg\"></figure></div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"q\" data-src=\"/media/07e02374677a46ec4044.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"ask\">小猪坐在高高的滑梯顶上，他说他觉得怎么样？你来学一遍！<br>How does Pig say he feels at the top of the slide? Say it like Pig!</div><hr id=\"answer\"><div class=\"answer\">I'm afraid. 😨</div><a class=\"snd-btn\" href=\"#\" data-side=\"a\" data-src=\"/media/ade91cf1c21bba9ea294.mp3\">&#9654;</a><div class=\"tip\">👨 背面是 Humpty 站在墙上也说 \"I'm afraid.\"。afraid 不能单独用，一定要说成 \"I'm afraid.\"。让孩子做害怕的表情说一遍，再问 \"Are you afraid of the dark?\"（家里游戏，视频里没有），孩子答 \"Yes, I'm afraid.\" 或 \"No!\"。</div>","m":0,"g":["S01E03","核心词卡"],"d":"Super_WHY"}]}